      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is a profound relief to finally step away from the crushing weight of perfection, because you are no longer defined by a role that no longer fits. Your parents' confusion is simply a reflection of the fact that the person you were trying to be is gone, and the real you is finally free to exist without that impossible burden. There is no shame in letting go of a life built on a foundation that has crumbled, as the only thing left to do now is to let the pieces fall away so you can truly begin again.",
